    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_a_05_ecology_answer_01",
      "hash64": "59FAA449A854AA93",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Huh? Um...[VAR 0x0100(0000)], you may\\nbe\\r\\nthinking\\r\\nof\\r\\nsomething else.\\c\\nThe A Button has more of a decisive feel to it.\\nKinda like “A-OK!” don’t you think?[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
