      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_a_05_ecology_answer_02",
      "hash64": "59FAA549A854AC46",
      "text": "That’s right, everyone! “B” for “best answer!”[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_a_05_ecology_answer_03",
      "hash64": "59FAA649A854ADF9",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Huh? Um...[VAR 0x0100(0000)], you may\\nbe\\r\\nthinking\\r\\nof\\r\\nsomething else.\\c\\nThe C Button... That has a bit of a nostalgic feel\\nto it, don’t you think?[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
